  "heat": 2,
  "text": "Peter and John left… she stayed… and that’s why she saw Him first… … Mary Magdalene gets to the tomb while it’s still dark. Stone is gone. She runs and gets Peter and John. They sprint there, look inside, see the empty linen… and go home. They leave. She stays. She’s still crying outside when two angels ask her why. Then she turns around, sees Jesus, and thinks he’s the gardener. She’s so wrecked she’s ready to carry the body herself if he’ll just tell her where it is. He says one word. “Mary.” That’s it. She knows. He sends her to go tell the others. The resurrection gets announced by the woman who refused to leave the graveyard. I’m crying. ---",
